          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005076747-How-to-view-raw-metric-or-profile-activity-data-in-Klaviyo#section1",
          "text": "Finding raw metric data"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005076747-How-to-view-raw-metric-or-profile-activity-data-in-Klaviyo#h_01JMFHASF4SXY0ZD222QJZDVF0",
          "text": "Understanding timestamps"
